WEBVTT

00:17:57.843 --> 00:18:01.090
We're not going to be just another family
who abandoned this."

00:18:01.114 --> 00:18:04.024
And so they unpacked all the boxes

00:18:04.048 --> 00:18:06.421
and she Googled, "Volunteer in Englewood."

00:18:06.445 --> 00:18:07.964
She had no idea what to do.

00:18:07.988 --> 00:18:11.418
She started volunteering,
she got on some boards ...

00:18:11.442 --> 00:18:12.601
She created something

00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:15.293
where the neighborhood could
watch documentaries together

00:18:15.317 --> 00:18:16.471
and have conversations.

00:18:16.495 --> 00:18:18.183
Now she runs something called RAGE,

00:18:18.207 --> 00:18:20.571
which is the community
organization in Englewood.

00:18:20.595 --> 00:18:22.457
CA: And that story is often told

00:18:22.481 --> 00:18:24.981
as "this is transformation
for the individual."

00:18:25.005 --> 00:18:26.823
But with these weavers,

00:18:26.847 --> 00:18:30.555
it sounds like it's also transformational
for the community that they are in.